#3111
The Cellar~
   This gathering room is where the ranger's come to trade tales over a 
mug of stout, and perhaps to trade a few items too. Equipment has been 
stored here in case an emergency should ever arise. You might even be able 
to convince the quartermaster to part with a few pieces, should you give 
him enough gold for them. 
