#3112
The Knight's Armory~
   This is where the knight's stockpile their weapons and armor. All knights 
must attempt to improve their armor and weapons whenever they get a chance, 
for only the finest equipped knight is worthy of serving their god. You can 
buy weapons and armor here if you need to, the knights are all too happy to 
prepare one of their own for a battle.
~
