The Chamber of Destruction~
   Weapons and armor are stored here. Death knights still prefer to wear 
armor, often donning full plate mail, almost always char black if possible. 
The guild has elected to sell extra armor and weapons, much of which was 
probably taken off students who died in training. If you need equipment, 
you've come to the right place.
